sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Manager as rhods-operator Manager<br/>8081/TCP health<br/>8443/TCP metrics<br/>9443/TCP webhook
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Handler<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant User as External User
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Gateway as Gateway / Envoy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant AuthProxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant Backend as Backend Service

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,Kustomize: Flow 1: Component Reconciliation
        Admin->>K8s: Create/Update DataScienceCluster CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8s->>Manager: Watch event (DSC change)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        Manager->>Manager: Component handler selected<br/>(reconciler-builder pattern)
        Manager->>Kustomize: Render kustomize manifests<br/>(in-process)
        Kustomize-->>Manager: Rendered K8s resources
        Manager->>K8s: Apply manifests (create/update)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        Manager->>K8s: Garbage-collect removed resources<br/>(GC action — always last)
        Manager->>K8s: Update DSC status<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over User,Backend: Flow 2: Gateway Ingress (OIDC Authentication)
        User->>Router: HTTPS request<br/>443/TCP TLS
        Router->>Gateway: Forward to Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
        Gateway->>AuthProxy: Route via HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS TLS (self-signed + DestinationRule)
        AuthProxy->>K8s: TokenReview validation<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        K8s-->>AuthProxy: Token valid / identity
        AuthProxy->>Backend: Forward with X-Auth-Request headers<br/>HTTP (pod-internal)
        Backend-->>AuthProxy: Response
        AuthProxy-->>Gateway: Response
        Gateway-->>Router: Response
        Router-->>User: HTTPS Response
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over K8s,Webhook: Flow 3: Webhook Admission
        K8s->>Webhook: Admission request<br/>443→9443/TCP HTTPS TLS (service-ca cert)
        Webhook->>Webhook: Validate/Mutate/Convert<br/>(singleton check, field validation,<br/>version conversion DSC v2↔v3)
        Webhook-->>K8s: AdmissionReview response<br/>(allow/deny)
    end
